flowchart TD
    subgraph CLIENT[Client Application]
        A[💥 Error Occurs<br>Crash / Network / Sync Failure]
        A --> B{Error Type}
        
        B -->|Recoverable| C1[🔄 Retry Logic<br>Exponential Backoff]
        C1 --> C2{Retry Success?}
        C2 -->|Yes| C3[✅ Continue Operation]
        C2 -->|No| C4[📱 Show User-Friendly Message<br>"Please try again later"]
        
        B -->|Non-Recoverable| C5[📝 Log Error Locally<br>With Stack Trace & Context]
        C5 --> C6[📤 Upload to Monitoring Service<br>Firebase Crashlytics / Sentry]
    end

    subgraph MONITORING[☁️ Monitoring & Alerting Stack]
        Crashlytics[🔥 Firebase Crashlytics<br>Crash Reports / Breadcrumbs]
        Performance[📈 Firebase Performance<br>Slow Rendering / Network]
        CustomLogs[📋 Custom Logging Service<br>Business Logic Errors]
        
        Aggregator[🧠 Log Aggregator<br>Error Grouping / Deduplication]
        Dashboard[📊 Monitoring Dashboard<br>Grafana / Firebase Console]
    end

    subgraph ALERTS[🚨 Alerting & Response]
        AlertRules{🚨 Alert Rules}
        AlertRules -->|Critical > 5% crash rate| PagerDuty[📱 PagerDuty / Opsgenie<br>On-Call Engineer Notified]
        AlertRules -->|High Severity| Slack[💬 Slack / Teams Channel<br>#alerts-critical]
        AlertRules -->|Medium Severity| Email[📧 Email to Engineering Team]
        AlertRules -->|Low Severity| Jira[📝 Auto-Create Jira Ticket<br>Backlog]
    end

    subgraph RESPONSE[🔧 Engineer Response]
        PagerDuty --> Engineer[👨‍💻 On-Call Engineer]
        Engineer --> Fix[🔨 Investigate & Fix]
        Fix --> Deploy[🚀 Deploy Hotfix]
        Deploy --> Resolve[✅ Issue Resolved]
    end

    C6 --> Crashlytics
    C6 --> CustomLogs
    
    Crashlytics --> Aggregator
    Performance --> Aggregator
    CustomLogs --> Aggregator
    
    Aggregator --> Dashboard
    Aggregator --> AlertRules
    AlertRules --> Slack
    AlertRules --> Email
    AlertRules --> Jira
    AlertRules --> PagerDuty
    
    style CLIENT fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#0d47a1,stroke-width:2px
    style MONITORING fill:#f1f8e9,stroke:#1b5e20,stroke-width:2px
    style ALERTS fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px
    style RESPONSE fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#b71c1c,stroke-width:2px